  "description": "ASP.NET Core authentication schemes for AuthService-issued credentials: AddConciergeSessionToken validates opaque session tokens (Redis cache + validate fallback, §11), AddConciergeJwtBearer validates client-credential JWTs (RS256/JWKS, typ guard, jti deny-list, client-revocation epoch), AddConciergePeerSignature validates peer-key RSA request signatures (Redis nonce replay protection), AddConciergeApiKey validates API keys against a host loader, plus WebSocket handshake support. The only Concierge.Auth.Client.* package referencing ASP.NET Core or StackExchange.Redis.",
